msgstr "Zaczyna się dziś"

#. A section label for goals like changing careers. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Nova carreira”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "Q1LbhS"
msgid "New career"
msgstr "Nowy zawód"

#. {goal} is an example goal like “become a data analyst in 6 months”; <quote> puts your language's quote marks around it. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Diga aonde quer chegar, como <quote>{goal}</quote>. O plano vai do básico às ferramentas da área e pula o que você já sabe.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "a5TSiQ"
msgid "Say where you want to get, like <quote>{goal}</quote>. Your plan goes from the basics to the tools of the field and skips what you already know."
msgstr "Powiedz, co chcesz osiągnąć, na przykład <quote>{goal}</quote>. Twój plan prowadzi od podstaw do narzędzi używanych w branży i pomija to, co już wiesz."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Para mudar de área, o que estudar e em que ordem.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "O5V56t"
msgid "Changing careers? What to study, and in what order."
msgstr "Zmiana zawodu? Czego się uczyć i w jakiej kolejności."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Todo plano funciona assim”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "UMn7XD"
msgid "Every plan works like this"
msgstr "Tak działa każdy plan"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Começa pelo que você já sabe”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "-g3daz"
msgid "It starts from what you know"
msgstr "Zaczyna od tego, co już wiesz"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Umas perguntas rápidas, em cerca de 2 minutos, e o plano pula o que você já sabe.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "7HSrMH"
msgid "A few quick questions, about 2 minutes, and your plan skips what you already know."
msgstr "Kilka krótkich pytań zajmie około 2 minut, a plan pominie to, co już wiesz."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Se faltar um dia, ele se ajusta”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "HZOzEA"
msgid "Miss a day and it adjusts"
msgstr "Dzień przerwy? Plan się dostosuje"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “O que ficou pendente vem primeiro no dia seguinte. Se alguma data mudar, o plano te avisa.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "s-aYFw"
msgid "What's left comes first the next day. If a date changes, your plan tells you."
msgstr "Następnego dnia zaczynasz od tego, co zostało. Jeśli zmieni się termin, plan da ci znać."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Traz de volta antes de você esquecer”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "oUlIsv"
msgid "It brings things back before you forget"
msgstr "Przypomina, zanim zapomnisz"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Revisões rápidas na hora certa, e cada erro volta para você praticar até acertar.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "iegI6Q"
msgid "Quick reviews at the right time, and every mistake comes back for you to practice until you get it right."
msgstr "Krótkie powtórki w odpowiednim momencie. Do każdego błędu wracasz w ćwiczeniach, aż odpowiesz poprawnie."

#. Zu is the study buddy's name. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Travou? Pergunte para Zu”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "eeEgWZ"
msgid "Stuck? Ask Zu"
msgstr "Coś niejasne? Zapytaj Zu"

#. Zu is the study buddy's name; the question is the one the learner is answering. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Zu, seu parceiro de estudos, explica ali mesmo na questão, do jeito mais simples que você precisar.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "M1vnV7"
msgid "Zu, your study buddy, explains right there in the question, as simply as you need."
msgstr "Zu, twój kumpel do nauki, tłumaczy wszystko przy samym pytaniu, tak prosto, jak potrzebujesz."

